        "question": {
          ":question/id": "0aee93da-e2ef-58f3-ac48-a0d395fa5cf9",
          ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ represents any integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\tan(x+\\pi)=\\tan(x+2n\\pi).$\n- **II.** $\\tan(x- \\frac{\\pi}{4})=\\tan(x+\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}).$\n- **III.** The domain is $(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}).$\n\nIn tangent equalities, consider values of $x$ where both sides are defined.",
